{"parentUuid":"9fb58ffd-f54d-4ba6-b521-6a98307ed963","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"9bdfc07b-8ff1-4e95-9c88-de7440fd6192","agentId":"a41a60545d5759240","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Eub16jy4rJW16KRnSjsauR","type":"tool_result","content":"## -i reflex\n## latency\n  \"rhythm/latency calibration\": [\n   \"summary\": \"Present timeline and display-time prediction, latency markers, interposed presenters (frame generation, XR compositor, cloud encoder), GPU-fram\n   \"concern\": \"latency\",\n   \"obligation\": \"Declare frame phase placement and latency contribution.\"\n   \"detection\": \"mmap reads on latency-critical workers\",\n       \"Cloud-streaming targets (latency, encode, input)\",\n       \"Remote generative-AI/inference boundary (auth, quotas, cost, latency, routing)\",\n       \"Reprojection & motion-to-photon latency\",\n## photo\n   \"summary\": \"View registry: view sources (gameplay camera, cinematic, editor, photo mode, XR pose) with priority/blend stack and shake/FOV channels, per-local-player views, \n       \"Reprojection & motion-to-photon latency\",\n       \"Input-to-photon latency & frame pacing (Reflex / Anti-Lag class)\",\n       \"Photogrammetry & scan ingestion\",\n       \"GAM.SYS.photo\",\n       \"Photo mode\",\n       \"Motion reduction & photosensitivity options\",\n       \"QA.CERT.photosensitivity\",\n## capture\n   \"OBS.CRASH.capture\",\n   \"summary\": \"Finding format (hypothesis, capture, attribution, expected gain), routing as a change request to the owning skill, time-boxed\n       \"Capture target game requirements (genre, scale, platforms, online model) as engine requirements\",\n       \"PLAT.SVC.capture\",\n       \"Media capture & share integration\",\n       \"Multi-view rendering: split-screen, PiP, captures, stereo/multiview and N-view (autostereo/light-field) outputs\",\n       \"RND.RHI.capture-integration\",\n       \"Programmatic GPU capture integration (PIX/RenderDoc class)\",\n## PVS\\|portal\n## occlusion\n  \"occlusion\": [\n  \"audio occlusion\": [\n   \"AUD.SPAT.occlusion\"\n       \"PLAT.XR.depth-occlusion\",\n       \"Real-world depth occlusion\",\n       \"GPU frustum & two-phase HZB occlusion culling\",\n       \"Screen-space GI & ambient occlusion\",\n       \"RND.GI.specular-occlusion\",\n## flare\n## DGF\\|dense geometry\n## swept\\|LSS\\|curve\ncurve data.\",\ncurve assets, tuning assets with overrides, live override layer.\",\ncurve/timeline widgets.\",\ncurves\",\nCurves, splines & interpolation\",\nLSS\ncurves)\",\nCurves, events & notifies\",\n## stochastic texture\n## g-buffer\\|gbuffer\\|scene textures\\|scene-textures\n## pre-exposure\\|preexposure\\|exposure\nexposure logging\",\nexposure\",\nexposure for HUD & menus\",\nexposure, end-to-end color management (working space, output transforms, OCIO), HDR output and cal\n## impostor\n       \"HLOD proxy meshes & impostors\",\n       \"Instanced crowd deformation: VAT, animation textures, animated impostors\",\n     \"Impostor generation\",\n, software micro-polygon rasterization, cluster streaming, discrete LOD, HLOD proxies and impostors, deforming-geometry LOD, displacement.\",\n## render target\\|render-to-texture\n## cloud render\\|pixel streaming\\|cloud gaming\n## watermark\\|lightmap\nlightmap baking\",\nlightmap-uv\",\nLightmap UV generation & atlas packing\",\nlightmaps, probe volumes, screen-space GI and AO, surface/radiance-cache hybrid GI, ReSTIR GI, ref\nlightmapping\"\n## shadow cache\\|invalidation\ninvalidation, state preservation hooks.\",\ninvalidation, distributed bakes, staleness reporting\",\ninvalidation, batching)\",\ninvalidation, state preservation) that assets, shaders, scripts, config and C++ live coding plug into;\n## world-space sprite\\|billboard\\|HD-2D\\|2.5D\n2.5D games\": [\n2.5D)\",\n2.5D, stylized; CPU-submitted rendering tier\",","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"1bf5ee1e-276d-4031-abe0-e48716f80d27","timestamp":"2026-09-29T16:20:28