{"parentUuid":"02111517-2156-4f80-b033-7c08cd69417f","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"9bdfc07b-8ff1-4e95-9c88-de7440fd6192","agentId":"a41a60545d5759240","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KkvuiaYfRGRzszv7TGYEwH","type":"tool_result","content":"M0 Walking skeleton indie-2d-client | Boots on one PC platform, runs the task graph, opens a window, presents through the RHI, reads input, draws a sprite and text, loads one cooked asset from a package, passes CI and the determinism/sanitizer smoke lanes. | frozen ['C-BASE', 'C-MEM', 'C-SYNC', 'C-TASK', 'C-ERR', 'C-INSTR']\nM1 Indie 2D vertical slice indie-2d-client | The indie-2d reference game is shippable on PC with editor, save, localization, accessibility baseline and hot reload; indie-2d-tools configuration builds. | frozen ['C-PAL', 'C-FRAME', 'C-ID', 'C-ECS', 'C-SER', 'C-ASSET', 'C-RES', 'C-DRAW2D', 'C-UI']\nM2 Standard 3D standard-3d-client | The standard-3d reference game runs on PC and one console tier with GPU-driven and CPU-submission paths, reference path tracer validation, and the lite-3d mobile configuration. | frozen ['C-RSCENE', 'C-INSTANCES', 'C-PHYS', 'C-ANIM', 'C-AUDIO', 'C-RHI']\nM3 Open world & large simulation open-world-client | Open-world reference slice streams at target speed within the arbitration budget; massim configuration closed and benchmarked. | frozen ['C-WORLD', 'C-SIGNIF', 'C-ENV']\nM4 Online online-3d-server | Online reference game with dedicated server, prediction/rollback, bot load test and cert pre-checks for online features. | frozen ['C-NET', 'C-NETLINK', 'C-REP', 'C-PREDICT']\nM5 AAA & ecosystem aaa-open-world-online-client | AAA reference slice; mods; XR; web; ML features behind optional contracts. | frozen []\n40:   \"name\": \"Rendering Critic\",\n41:   \"mandate\": \"Graphics architecture and currency of rendering techniques; GPU-driven, bindless, explicit-API assumptions; scalability from 2D mobile to path tracing.\",\n42-   \"checks\": [\n43-    \"no draw-call-centric or DX11-era assumptions\",\n44-    \"render graph owns sync and aliasing\",\n45-    \"technique maturity labels are honest\",\n46-    \"scale-down path exists for each feature\"\n47-   ],\n48-   \"scope\": [\n49-    \"subtree:render-architect\",\n--\n291:   \"mandate\": \"Does the architecture block likely next-5-year technologies: neural rendering, work graphs, cluster RT, ML animation, new storage and memory, new platforms.\",\n292-   \"checks\": [\n293-    \"extension points exist for emerging techniques\",\n294-    \"maturity labels allow promotion\",\n295-    \"no hard-coding of today's API limits\"\n296-   ],\n297-   \"scope\": [\n298-    \"all\"\n299-   ],\n--\n326:   \"mandate\": \"Find accidental legacy architecture: central sequential update loops, deep inheritance, global state, hot-path virtual dispatch, CPU-driven rendering, coarse locks, global renderer sync, frame-tied lifetimes, universal scene graphs, synchronous IO/loading, single-thread-first design, OpenGL/DX11 assumptions, monoliths. A flagged pattern needs justification, not removal.\",\n327-   \"checks\": [\n328-    \"each pattern in data/legacy-patterns.json absent or justified by an ADR\"\n329-   ],\n330-   \"scope\": [\n331-    \"all\"\n332-   ],\n333-   \"stages\": [\n334-    \"G1\",","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"4f5f5316-3beb-49c7-88a5-9faa936fda11","timestamp":"2026-09-29T16:21:30.170Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"02111517-2156-4f80-b033-7c08cd69417f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1"}
